  "description": "Liquid Brun by French Avenue is a bold and luxurious fragrance built on a perfect harmony of spice, sweetness, and warmth. It opens with vibrant top notes of cinnamon, orange blossom, cardamom, and bergamot — a lively and inviting introduction. The heart reveals creamy bourbon vanilla and elemi resin, adding smooth depth and sophistication. The base settles into rich praline, ambroxan, guaiac wood, and musk, creating a warm, woody finish with irresistible allure. This scent delivers power and elegance, perfect for evening wear and cool weather — a statement fragrance that lingers long after you leave the room.",
